<title>ITALY: Italian crude imports up 0.2 pct Jan-Aug.</title>
<headline>Italian crude imports up 0.2 pct Jan-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian crude oil imports  rose 0.2 percent year-on-year to 47.9 million tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, industry association Unione Petrolifera said in a statement.</p>
<p>Libya accounted for 32.7 percent of imports, Iran 17.6 percent, Saudi Arabia 14.4 percent, the former Soviet Union 12.3 percent and Egypt 5.1 percent. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
